irá a Fausto a menos que firme una confesión donde aclare que Rosa Blanco fue condenada injustamente. Fausto manipula diciendo que también Ezequiel confiese que mató a su hermano Augusto, el papá de Camila. Ella llega a tiempo para impedir que Ezequiel le dispare a Fausto." type="episode" contentRating="NONADULT" duration="3073000" grandparentArt="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1672724.jpg" grandparentGuid="plex://show/66ea19708651b52ba9cee047" grandparentKey="/library/metadata/66ea19708651b52ba9cee047" grandparentRatingKey="66ea19708651b52ba9cee047" grandparentThumb="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1920/2/1672724.jpg" grandparentTitle="Piel Salvaje" grandparentType="show" index="104" parentIndex="1" requiresConsent="1" skipParent="1" thumb="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1672724.jpg" title="S01:E104" userState="0"><Image alt="S01:E104" type="coverArt" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1672724.jpg"/><Image alt="S01:E104" type="coverPoster" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1920/2/1672724.jpg"/><Image alt="S01:E104" type="snapshot" url="https://cdn-images.watch4.com/1080/3/1672724.jpg"/><Genre filter="genre=6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" id="6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" key="/library/sections/home/all?genre=6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" ratingKey="genre_6a0c2728768cf9b31f6fe02a" slug="bingeworthy" tag="Bingeworthy" type="directory" context="tag.genre"/><Media beginsAt="1781068134" duration="3073000" endsAt="1781071207" id="6a1ecd1ce0971a8937b4e49e" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1781091508" duration="3197000" endsAt="1781094705" id="6a201ec624c1471c9b43ab21" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/><Media beginsAt="1781121297" duration="3330000" endsAt="1781124627" id="6a201ec624c1471c9b43ab2b" onAir="0" premiere="0" videoResolution="720" origin="livetv"/></Video><Video guid="plex://episode/6a201eba24c1471c9b43aaf2" key="/library/metadata/6a201eba24c1471c9b43aaf2" ratingKey="6a201eba24c1471c9